{"title": "Hunter's Mark (passive feature)", "pageid": 57462, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hunter's_Mark_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Prey%27s_Scent.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Prey%27s_Scent.webp/300px-Prey%27s_Scent.webp, /w/images/2/2f/Prey%27s_Scent.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Prey%27s_Scent.webp/300px-Prey%27s_Scent.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Prey%27s_Scent.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hunter's Mark</b> is a passive feature that grants a creature extra damage against their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/38px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/50px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\">Hunter's Mark</a> target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you attack your quarry, you deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-weapon\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" title=\"Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-weapon\">Weapon</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715023742\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 932/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5300/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2720/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643723/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.097      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.097      1 -total\n 48.23%   14.517      1 Template:PageSeo